&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27.7pt;padding-right:9pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27.7pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（注５）「敷金及び保証金」は、１年内回収予定の差入保証金を含めています。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27.7pt;padding-right:9pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27.7pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（注６）「長期借入金」は、１年内返済予定の長期借入金を含めています。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27.7pt;padding-right:9pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27.7pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（注７）「長期預り敷金保証金」は、１年内返済予定の預り保証金を含めています。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27.7pt;padding-right:9pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27.7pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（注８）金銭債権の連結決算日後の償還予定額&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;前連結会計年度（&lt;span&gt;2023年２月28日&lt;/span&gt;）&lt;/p&gt;
